# A door or window left open: said after 10 minutes, if it still is.
workflow door-open
about A door or window left open: tells you after 10 minutes, if it still is.
start <door starts>
tag no
limits steps 10, days 1

step wait
wait 10m

step check
tool home/home_wait {"device": "{event.device}", "property": "open", "condition": "==", "value": "yes", "timeout_s": 0}
if check has not within goto shut

step tell
say {input} has been open for 10 minutes.
end

step shut
end
